# slow and warm, A minor, loops
tempo 76
rows 4

inst bell  triangle vol 0.22 attack 0.004 decay 0.9 sustain 0.0 release 0.2
inst pad   sine     vol 0.14 attack 0.5 decay 0.6 sustain 0.7 release 0.9 vibrato 0.006
inst bass  triangle vol 0.30 attack 0.01 decay 0.7 sustain 0.5 release 0.3

pattern am
bell  A4 .  C5 .  | E5 .  C5 .  | A4 .  C5 .  | E5 .  G5 .
pad   A3 .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  .
bass  A2 .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | A2 .  .  .  | E2 .  .  .

pattern f
bell  F4 .  A4 .  | C5 .  A4 .  | F4 .  A4 .  | C5 .  E5 .
pad   F3 .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  .
bass  F2 .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | F2 .  .  .  | C3 .  .  .

pattern c
bell  E4 .  G4 .  | C5 .  G4 .  | E4 .  G4 .  | C5 .  D5 .
pad   C4 .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  .
bass  C3 .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | C3 .  .  .  | G2 .  .  .

pattern g
bell  D4 .  G4 .  | B4 .  G4 .  | D4 .  G4 .  | B4 .  D5 .
pad   B3 .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  -
bass  G2 .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | G2 .  .  .  | E2 .  .  .

pattern am2
bell  A4 .  E5 .  | A5 .  E5 .  | C5 .  E5 .  | A5 .  B5 .
pad   A3 .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  .
bass  A2 .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | A2 .  .  .  | E2 .  .  .

pattern g2
bell  B4 .  D5 .  | G5 .  D5 .  | B4 .  G4 .  | E4 .  .  .
pad   G3 .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | E3 .  .  .  | .  .  .  -
bass  G2 .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | E2 .  .  .  | .  .  .  .

order am f c g am2 f c g2
